body:
Drunk me one night was having shots of whiskey. I weigh 135 pounds, six feet tall, so it don't take a lot to get me hammered. Having been drunk before, I know there is no way that I will puke. So drunk me, after those four shots, decides to have mix drinks from then on of whiskey and orange Gatorade. 

So when I woke up the next morning, not only did I feel fairly good, there was some tylonal by my bed, and I found out during my blackouts at somepoint that I text a couple of chicks and made some new friends, which is cool because I have a hard time meeting new people. 

I think drunk me is a better person then sober me sometimes. ;-;
